Uses hdmlmake ( from ohwr.org ) to make Xilinx ISE project.

Look at wrpc-v2.1 , then

cd uob-hep-pc049a/trunk/firmware/syn/pc049a/demo

hdlmake-v1.0 --make-ise --ise-proj

make

----------------------

*NB* Tested with ISE version 14.7 . Other versions may not work.

Hacked version of hdlmake that can (just about) work with ISE Coregen *.xco 
files copied into firmware directory.

cd maroc_csa/firmware/syn/pc049a/demo

python ../../../hdl-make/hdlmake  ise-project


